WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.775
Let’s walk through Your role in the exercise.

00:00:02.775 --> 00:00:07.075
Use this opening step to establish ownership before learning controls

00:00:07.075 --> 00:00:07.250
.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:10.412
Identify what this seat creates or reviews, what must

00:00:10.412 --> 00:00:13.575
be handed to another role, and which decisions remain

00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:15.287
outside your authority.

00:00:15.287 --> 00:00:18.425
On this slide, as Green Team Facilitator, you

00:00:18.425 --> 00:00:22.000
keep Green Team's deliberation moving and own the final review

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:22.988
boundary.

00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:26.160
In practice, use the deck to structure the room

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.348
, inspect what the Scribe forwarded, resolve omissions with

00:00:29.348 --> 00:00:32.310
the team, and submit only when the artifact represents

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:33.922
the agreed decision.

00:00:33.922 --> 00:00:36.710
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:39.197
The Scribe authors and forwards the record.

00:00:39.197 --> 00:00:41.422
You review, project, and submit it to White

00:00:41.422 --> 00:00:42.297
Cell.

00:00:42.297 --> 00:00:45.410
Presentation and submission are separate actions.
